{"id":"16-339-2-2","zh":"以 ja 结尾的词根","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-340-2-3","zh":"Ji，表示胜利。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-340-4-5","zh":"Jeti（胜）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-340-6-9","zh":"Jayati（胜），parājayati（败）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-340-10-14","zh":"奉行正法的人胜过了主人。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-340-15-18","zh":"奉行正法的人落败了。","confidence":55}
{"id":"16-340-19-21","zh":"他们向国王祝胜（jayāpesuṃ）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-340-22-23","zh":"Jayāpetvā（祝胜之后）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-340-24-37","zh":"这里，jayāpesuṃ 的意思是：他们说了“愿您胜利”这句祝愿的话。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-340-38-73","zh":"Jayanaṃ（胜利）、jitaṃ（已胜）、jayo（胜利）、vijitaṃ（已征服）、jino（胜者）、jetā（胜者）、jeto、jito māro（被战胜的魔）、māraṃ jito（战胜了魔）、jitavā、jitāvī、vijitāvī（已获胜者）、māraji（胜魔者）、lokaji（胜世间者）、odhijino（部分胜者）、anodhijino（完全胜者）、jito（被战胜的）。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-340-74-83","zh":"Vijito（被征服的），jetuṃ、vijetuṃ（为了战胜），jitvā、vijitvā（战胜之后）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-340-84-99","zh":"而这个词根归入 kī 等类时，就有“jināti、jinitvā”等词形。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-341-2-4","zh":"Ji，表示压服。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-341-5-6","zh":"Jeti（压服）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-341-7-8","zh":"Jino（压服者）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-341-9-12","zh":"词形与前面相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-341-13-30","zh":"这里，“阿难，你们这些善人已经克服了，后世的人们将会轻视稻米肉饭”这句圣典文句，可以证明压服的意思。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-341-31-37","zh":"因为这里的 vijitaṃ，意思就是“已经压服”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-342-2-4","zh":"Ju，表示行走。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-342-5-8","zh":"这里指的是快速行走。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-342-9-10","zh":"Javati（疾行）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-342-11-24","zh":"Javanaṃ（速行）、javo（速度）、javaṃ、javanto（疾行者）、javanacittaṃ（速行心）、javanapañño（慧速者）、javanahaṃso（疾飞的天鹅）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-342-25-28","zh":"以如心念般的速度随意前往。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-343-2-3","zh":"Je，表示衰损。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-343-4-5","zh":"Jīyati（衰损）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-343-6-10","zh":"e 音被替换为 īya。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-343-11-24","zh":"因为按照佛典的用法，可以见到“你为什么要我因财物而衰损”这样的圣典文句。","confidence":50}
{"id":"16-343-25-35","zh":"而精通语法论的人则说词形是“jāyati”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-344-2-4","zh":"Sajja，表示行走。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-344-5-6","zh":"Sajjati（行走）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-345-2-5","zh":"Kuju、khuju，表示偷盗。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-345-6-7","zh":"Kojati（偷盗）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-345-8-9","zh":"Khojati（偷盗）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-346-2-4","zh":"Vaja，表示行走。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-346-5-8","zh":"Dhaja、dhaji 也是如此。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-346-9-10","zh":"Vajati（行走）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-346-11-12","zh":"Abbajati（前往）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-346-13-15","zh":"也会得到人身。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-346-16-27","zh":"Vajo（牛栏）、vajanaṃ（行走）、pavajanaṃ、pabbajjā（出家）、pabbajito（出家者）、pabbājito（被放逐者）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-347-2-9","zh":"从自己的国家被放逐，去到了别的地方；","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-348-2-8","zh":"应当造一个大仓库，用来收藏种种恶言。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-349-2-3","zh":"Dhajati（行走）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-349-4-5","zh":"Dhajo（旗帜）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-349-6-7","zh":"Dhañjati（行走）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-349-8-9","zh":"Dhañjanaṃ（行走）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-349-10-14","zh":"这里，**dhajo** 是指旗帜。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-349-15-18","zh":"dhañjanaṃ 是指行走。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-350-2-5","zh":"Aja，也表示投掷。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-350-6-9","zh":"这里的 ca 字正是兼顾“行走”这一义的。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-350-10-11","zh":"Ajati（行走、驱赶）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-350-12-13","zh":"Ajo（山羊）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-350-14-18","zh":"这里，**ajo** 是指羊（eḷaka）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-350-19-32","zh":"它的同义词有：ajo、eḷako、urabbho、avi、meṇḍo。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-350-33-46","zh":"其中，**urabbho** 是指 eḷaka，也就是也被称为“ajo”的羊。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-350-47-51","zh":"**avī** 是指毛色发红的羊。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-350-52-56","zh":"**meṇḍo** 是指角弯曲的羊。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-350-57-64","zh":"正因如此，《迦那迦本生》把公羊车和山羊车分开来说。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-350-65-82","zh":"此外，由于 ajeḷakaṃ 一词把 eḷaka 与 aja 分开来说，eḷaka 这个词也应包括 meṇḍa；因为《大药本生》义注中说过 meṇḍa 与 eḷaka 没有分别。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-351-2-5","zh":"Ajja、sajja，表示获取。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-351-6-8","zh":"ajjana 就是获取的动作。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-351-9-10","zh":"Ajjati（获取）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-351-11-12","zh":"Sajjati（获取）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-352-2-4","zh":"Kajja，表示伤害。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-352-5-7","zh":"byathana 就是伤害。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-352-8-9","zh":"Kajjati（伤害）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-353-2-5","zh":"Khajja，也表示洁净。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-353-6-8","zh":"majjana 就是清净。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-353-9-12","zh":"这里的 ca 字兼顾“伤害”这一义。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-353-13-14","zh":"Khajjati（伤害、洁净）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-353-15-16","zh":"Khajjūro（海枣树）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-354-2-4","zh":"Khaja，表示搅动。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-354-5-7","zh":"mantha 就是搅拌。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-354-8-9","zh":"Khajati（搅动）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-355-2-4","zh":"Khaji，表示行走不便。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-355-5-9","zh":"“尊者，您为什么跛着走呢？”","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-355-10-12","zh":"两人都是跛子。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-355-13-18","zh":"Khañjanaṃ（跛行）、khañjituṃ（为了跛行）、khañjitvā（跛行之后）。","confidence":80}
